{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhodias is a mid-rank criminal. One day, an inexplicable urge prompts him to leave his gang behind and take to the distant mountains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While wandering the alien hinterlands, he comes across a handsome traveler who invites him to the Temple of Renewal, where he claims Rhodias is bound to obtain many answers to his questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being in the sacred Temple reveals unexpected things about him, including a primal hunger he didn\u2019t know he had. Even stranger\u2026 he now has a new desire, he\u2019s not so comfortable admitting: a desire for a close connection with the men he meets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into this new mature story filled with mystery, tentacles and gorgeous men!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497960/extras/c5f7651b04c44a3c7b56b478c1ae4fe6.poster.avif?t=1758833663\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497960/extras/c5f7651b04c44a3c7b56b478c1ae4fe6.webp?t=1758833663\" class=\"bb_img\" width=630 height=354 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhodias -\u00a0</strong>Terran from an outer space colony</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A man who thinks of himself first and foremost. An incident that occured 3 months ago brought major changes in his life and he is now in search for answers. He can remain calm even in high-stress situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497960/extras/22b8d4b4137519eddf1e356a5d404b66.poster.avif?t=1758833663\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497960/extras/22b8d4b4137519eddf1e356a5d404b66.webp?t=1758833663\" class=\"bb_img\" width=630 height=354 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyn Deh - Odarian</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is deeply loyal to Varga, his mentor whom he assists in his everyday life.\u00a0He is not thrilled at the prospect of living with Rhodias, whom he dislikes at first sight. Like most Odarians, he suffers from a poor immune system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497960/extras/5d7f813eb2f30bd2d630e81be1518d8e.poster.avif?t=1758833663\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497960/extras/5d7f813eb2f30bd2d630e81be1518d8e.webp?t=1758833663\" class=\"bb_img\" width=630 height=354 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varga - Izakarian</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He offers Rhodias to stay in the Temple of Renewal, where he is a respected and longtime member. Despite his warm demeanor, he never speaks of his own past. He trusts Cyn Deh more than anyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497960/extras/467bb36d074d670efcba9fa53521e686.poster.avif?t=1758833663\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497960/extras/467bb36d074d670efcba9fa53521e686.webp?t=1758833663\" class=\"bb_img\" width=630 height=354 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jah-Roe - Zephirian and Kivyanese hybrid</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high-ranking assistant to one of the Temple of Renewal's administrators. He is hardly ever seen outside of the Archives or his cave-like home. When Rhodias flirts with him, he flirts right back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497960/extras/7647d2e7e1a3d9ccab4339e8addbbb0b.poster.avif?t=1758833663\" width=631 height=351 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497960/extras/7647d2e7e1a3d9ccab4339e8addbbb0b.webm?t=1758833663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snoop around strange caves and people's homes, find more about the temple and help Rhodias uncover the mysteries of the Temple!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 20 hours of play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 CGs (not counting variations)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full English voice over</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 love interests (including a polyamorous route)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigame investigations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtracks</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3497960?t=1758833663","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497960/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758833663","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497960/9c027ac14f575f90051a459a1a624d340103e053/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758833663","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497960/9c027ac14f575f90051a459a1a624d340103e053/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758833663","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam